        "created_at": "2021-06-07T02:10:39.287Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What things does the <em>Spirit Island Errata Pack</em> actually fix? Are they just typos,* or actual rule differences, or some mix of both? I’d appreciate some kind of list. Thanks in advance.</p>\n<p>*Such as “Shadows’ Flicker Like Flame,” which is I think the only error I know about.</p>",
